如果你有一只生病的猫，你就会懂的，对吧？

1264
00:53:45.210 --> 00:53:46.970
You wouldn't be searching for that information.
你不会再去搜集那些信息了。

1265
00:53:46.970 --> 00:53:48.190
You would know it.
你会直接知道的。

1266
00:53:48.430 --> 00:53:48.910
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

1267
00:53:49.110 --> 00:53:55.330
And they had, the props department had given me this blue notepad with all of the different
他们，道具组给了我这个蓝色的记事本，上面写着所有的

1268
00:53:55.330 --> 00:53:58.530
steps written out, but not in the same order, not exactly.
步骤，但顺序不对，完全不一样。

