So like actually, if I looked at the notepad, it would have messed me up.
所以实际上，如果我看了那个记事本，我反而会被搞砸。

1270
00:54:01.530 --> 00:54:06.150
But I saved the notepad with all of Sprinkles medications.
但我把写有小饼干所有用药的记事本留作纪念了。

1271
00:54:06.690 --> 00:54:10.050
And it's the one I hand Dwight in the scene.
就是我在戏里递给德怀特的那个。

1272
00:54:10.270 --> 00:54:11.290
He's holding it.
他当时正拿着它。

1273
00:54:11.290 --> 00:54:12.510
But I saved it.
但我把它保存下来了。

1274
00:54:12.630 --> 00:54:14.630
I never tore off that first page.
我从来没有撕掉过第一页。

1275
00:54:14.630 --> 00:54:15.770
And I still have it.
而且我一直留着它。

1276
00:54:15.870 --> 00:54:17.610
And the whole notepad is unused.
整个记事本都是崭新没用过的。

1277
00:54:17.950 --> 00:54:22.570
And that first page just has all of Sprinkles, like medicines and how to care for her.
第一页上只有小饼干的各种药物以及如何照顾她的说明。

1278
00:54:23.770 --> 00:54:25.170
Oh, my gosh.
噢，天哪。

1279
00:54:25.450 --> 00:54:25.990
Oh, look.
