You thought I was trying to hide in my steering wheel.
你以为我是想把头埋进方向盘里躲起来。

1780
01:21:42.880 --> 01:21:47.280
I thought it worked because I thought Pam was trying to possibly cover her face from
我觉得起作用了，因为我觉得帕姆可能是想挡住脸，不让

